          <a href="https://saperly.com/docs/sdks/node" class="shrink-0 rounded-xl border border-brand-yellow/40 bg-brand-yellow/10 px-4 py-2 text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-brand-dark dark:text-brand-yellow hover:bg-brand-yellow/20 transition-colors" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            API docs →
          </a>
        </header>
